codex-usage-tray (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Detect signed-in and signed-out Codex account states before reading limits.
  * Add a Codex-managed ChatGPT browser sign-in action and prompt.
  * Show sanitized account email and plan details in the local tray menu.
  * Refresh account state and usage limits immediately after successful login.
  * Keep credential storage delegated to Codex and document the local data flow.
  * Update desktop metadata, documentation, and packaging for version 0.1.1.
  * Preserve the declared Python 3.11 compatibility for type aliases.
  * Expand account, login, application, and client test coverage.

